 "remarks": "1 BEDROOM + YOUR OWN PRIVATE FLEX SPACE. Bedford Creative offers boutique apartment living in Downtown Stamford with modern finishes, thoughtfully designed amenities, and a flexible live/work lifestyle. This Dual Space One-Bedroom features a private apartment and a separate flex space located directly across the hall, offering added versatility for a home office, creative studio, or additional private space. The apartment features an open-concept layout, oversized windows, and a contemporary kitchen with ENERGY STAR stainless steel appliances, quartz countertops, and custom cabinetry. The fully electric building is designed with efficiency and comfort in mind. Residents enjoy access to a fitness center, resident lounge, landscaped outdoor terrace, dog park, and modern lobby lounge. Conveniently located near downtown restaurants, shopping, nightlife, and Metro-North, this residence offers an ideal combination of urban convenience, privacy, and flexible living space.",
